        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Svickova rewards patience. The overnight marinade softens the beef and infuses it with the flavour of the vegetables and spices. The sauce is made by blending the braising vegetables with cream -- simple in concept, remarkable in result." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
