        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Where this dish lives" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Czech Republic. The national comfort food. Served in every Czech pub and at Christmas dinners. Bread dumplings (knedliky) are the traditional partner, used to soak up the creamy sauce." }]
      }
